Error [E0433]: This SQL value is thrown away
  --> external_boundaries_seed_origin_facts_4.jet:6:9
    |
  6 |     SQL.raw(value)
    |         ^^^
 Why: `run` has no return type, so it returns nothing and the value of its last line is lost
 Fix: If `run` should return it, write `-> SQL` after its parameter list; to discard it on purpose, write `.drop("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433

